---
<Layout
  title="マットレスおすすめランキング2026｜腰痛・リカバリー対応で徹底比較"
  description="腰痛・コリ・寝返り問題に対応する人気マットレス6商品を徹底比較。雲のやすらぎ・REVERIA・NELLなどを、寝心地・体圧分散・耐久性・通気性・お手入れ・価格の6軸で30点満点採点しました。"
>
  <Header />
  <main>

    <!-- ===== パンくず ===== -->
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="container">
        <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'マットレス' }]} />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
    <section class="hero-section">
      <a href="#top3">
        <picture>
          <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="/hero-sp.png" />
          <img src="/hero-pc.png" alt="腰痛・コリに効くマットレスを徹底比較" class="hero-img" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        </picture>
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 人気マットレス 6商品ランキング ===== -->
    <section class="section" id="top3">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">人気マットレス 6商品ランキング</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">腰痛・コリ・寝返り問題に対応する人気6商品を、当サイト独自の30点満点スコアで徹底比較。気になる商品はレビュー記事と公式サイトで詳しくチェックしてください。</p>
        <div class="top3-list">
          {products.map(p => (
            <div class="top3-card">
              <div class="top3-header">
                <span class={`rank-circle rank-circle-${p.rank <= 3 ? p.rank : 'other'}`}>{p.rank}</span>
                <p class="top3-name">{p.name}</p>
              </div>
              <img src={p.image} alt={p.name} class="top3-img" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="top3-score-row">
                <span class="top3-score">{p.score.toFixed(1)}</span>
                <span class="top3-score-max">/ 30点</span>
              </div>
              <p class="top3-price">{p.price}</p>
              <ul class="top3-tags">
                {p.tags.map(tag => <li>#{tag}</li>)}
              </ul>
              <p class="top3-summary">{p.summary}</p>
              <div class="top3-cta-row">
                <a href={p.affiliateHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="top3-cta-btn">
                  公式サイトを見る →
                </a>
                {p.href !== '#' ? (
                  <a href={p.href} class="top3-review-btn">レビュー記事を読む →</a>
                ) : (
                  <span class="top3-review-btn top3-review-btn--coming">準備中</span>
                )}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 比較表 ===== -->
    <section class="section section-bg" id="compare">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">人気マットレス 6商品 徹底比較表</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">当サイトの採点6項目を軸に、人気マットレス6商品を一覧で比較できます。スコアが高いほどおすすめです。</p>
        <div class="compare-wrap">
          <table class="compare-table">
            <colgroup>
              <col class="col-label" />
              {products.map(() => <col class="col-product" />)}
            </colgroup>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="row-label">項目</th>
                {products.map(p => <th>{p.shortName || p.name}</th>)}
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">総合スコア</td>
                {products.map(p => <td><strong class="score-total">{p.score.toFixed(1)}</strong><span class="score-max">/30点</span></td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">①硬さ・反発力</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class={`score-cell-bg score-bg-${Math.round(p.itemScores.feel)}`}>{p.itemTexts.feel}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">②体圧分散</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class={`score-cell-bg score-bg-${Math.round(p.itemScores.support)}`}>{p.itemTexts.support}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">③耐久性</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class={`score-cell-bg score-bg-${Math.round(p.itemScores.durability)}`}>{p.itemTexts.durability}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">④通気性</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class={`score-cell-bg score-bg-${Math.round(p.itemScores.breath)}`}>{p.itemTexts.breath}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">⑤お手入れ</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class={`score-cell-bg score-bg-${Math.round(p.itemScores.care)}`}>{p.itemTexts.care}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">⑥保証・お試し</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class={`score-cell-bg score-bg-${Math.round(p.itemScores.cost)}`}>{p.itemTexts.cost}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">価格（シングル）</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class="compare-info">{p.price}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">主な素材</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class="compare-info">{p.material}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">硬さ</td>
                {products.map(p => <td class="compare-info">{p.firmness}</td>)}
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="row-label">公式サイト</td>
                {products.map(p => (
                  <td><a href={p.affiliateHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="compare-btn">公式へ →</a></td>
                ))}
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>


<style>
  .hero-section { width: 100%; line-height: 0; }
  .hero-section a { display: block; }
  .hero-img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

  /* セクション共通 */
  .section { padding: 3rem 1rem; }
  .section-bg { background: #F7F4EC; }
  .section-title { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1B3A5C; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 3px solid #1B3A5C; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .section-title { font-size: 1.25rem; } .section { padding: 2rem 1rem; } }

  /* TOP3 */
  .top3-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .top3-card { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
  .top3-card:hover { border-color: #C9A84C; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(201,168,76,0.15); }
  .top3-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
  .rank-circle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .rank-circle-1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFD700 0%, #FFA500 100%); box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(255,165,0,0.35); }
  .rank-circle-2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C0C0C0 0%, #808080 100%); box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(128,128,128,0.3); }
  .rank-circle-3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #CD7F32 0%, #8B4513 100%); box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(139,69,19,0.3); }
  .rank-circle-other { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B3A5C 0%, #2C5780 100%); box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(27,58,92,0.3); }
  .top3-name { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: #1B3A5C; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .top3-img { width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 3/2; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; background: #F7F4EC; }
  .top3-score-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .top3-score { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #C9A84C; }
  .top3-score-max { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .top3-price { font-weight: 700; color: #1B3A5C; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .top3-tags { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 0.85rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .top3-tags li { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #C9A84C; font-weight: 700; }
  .top3-summary { font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #555; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .top3-cta-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .top3-review-btn { display: block; padding: 0.6rem; background: #fff; color: #1B3A5C; border: 2px solid #1B3A5C; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; }
  .top3-review-btn:hover { background: #1B3A5C; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .top3-review-btn--coming { background: #f0f0f0; color: #888; border-color: #d1d5db; cursor: default; }
  .top3-review-btn--coming:hover { background: #f0f0f0; color: #888; }
  .top3-cta-btn { display: block; padding: 0.7rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A84C 0%, #B8973B 100%); color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(201,168,76,0.3); }
  .top3-cta-btn:hover { opacity: 0.92; text-decoration: none; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .top3-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* 選び方ガイド */
  .pillow-guide-section { background: #F7F4EC; }
  .pillow-guide-lead { text-align: center; margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.85; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .pillow-guide-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .pillow-guide-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 58, 92, 0.08); display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
  .pillow-guide-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(27, 58, 92, 0.14); }
  .pillow-guide-icon-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 72px; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .pillow-guide-svg { width: 72px; height: 72px; }
  .pillow-guide-num { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A84C 0%, #B8973B 100%); color: #fff; width: 32px; height: 32px; line-height: 32px; text-align: center; border-radius: 50%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 auto 0.5rem; align-self: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3); }
  .pillow-guide-title { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1B3A5C; text-align: center; line-height: 1.45; }
  .pillow-guide-text { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #333; flex: 1; }
  .pillow-guide-check { background: #F7F4EC; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; margin-top: auto; }
  .pillow-guide-check-title { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1B3A5C; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .pillow-guide-check ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; }
  .pillow-guide-check li { font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #555; padding: 0.2rem 0 0.2rem 1.1rem; position: relative; }
  .pillow-guide-check li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #C9A84C; font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .pillow-guide-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .pillow-guide-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* フィルター */
  .filter-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: end; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
  .filter-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; flex: 1; min-width: 160px; }
  .filter-group label { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1B3A5C; }
  .filter-group select { padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
  .filter-reset { padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #1B3A5C; color: #1B3A5C; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  .filter-reset:hover { background: #1B3A5C; color: #fff; }
  .filter-count { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .no-results { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .hidden { display: none !important; }

  /* ランキングリスト */
  .ranking-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .ranking-card { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.5rem; position: relative; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
  .ranking-card:hover { border-color: #C9A84C; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(201,168,76,0.15); }
